orn</span><span begin="41.197" end="41.431">ing</span> <span begin="41.431" end="41.641">from</span> <span begin="41.641" end="41.839">the</span> <span begin="41.839" end="42.173">nights</span> <span begin="42.173" end="42.652">calm</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清晨从夜晚的平静中醒来</span></p><p begin="43.011" end="45.427" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.011" end="43.087">And</span> <span begin="43.087" end="43.258">see</span> <span begin="43.258" end="43.446">the</span> <span begin="43.446" end="43.796">sun</span><span begin="43.796" end="44.208">rise</span> <span begin="44.208" end="44.418">while</span> <span begin="44.418" end="44.612">we</span> <span begin="44.612" end="44.957">stay</span> <span begin="44.957" end="45.427">tall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着日出</span></p><p begin="45.801" end="48.609" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.801" end="45.999">Per</span><span begin="45.999" end="46.191">fect</span> <span begin="46.191" end="46.389">in</span><span begin="46.389" end="46.602">tu</span><span begin="46.602" end="47.014">ition,</span> <span begin="47.014" end="47.199">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="47.199" end="47.415">my</span> <span begin="47.415" end="47.611">an</span><span begin="47.611" end="47.831">gel</span> <span begin="47.831" end="48.004">one</span> <span begin="48.004" end="48.198">I</span> <span begin="48.198" end="48.401">vi</span><span begin="48.401" end="48.609">sioned</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持着一种完美的直觉</span></p><p begin="48.661" end="50.155" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.661" end="48.814">That</span> <span begin="48.814" end="48.999">I</span> <span begin="48.999" end="49.181">al</span><span begin="49.181" end="49.370">ways</span> <span begin="49.370" end="49.547">could</span> <span begin="49.547" end="49.751">en</span><span begin="49.751" end="49.975">vi</span><span begin="49.975" end="50.155">sion</span><span ttm:role