1"><span begin="2:16.211" end="2:16.404">In</span> <span begin="2:16.404" end="2:16.592">the</span> <span begin="2:16.592" end="2:16.915">ugly</span> <span begin="2:16.915" end="2:17.379">side,</span> <span begin="2:17.379" end="2:17.567">gen</span><span begin="2:17.567" end="2:17.801">tly</span> <span begin="2:17.801" end="2:17.998">blind</span><span begin="2:17.998" end="2:18.204">ed</span> <span begin="2:18.204" end="2:18.586">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">丑陋的一面，轻轻地蒙蔽过我的双眼</span></p><p begin="2:18.586" end="2:22.263" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.586" end="2:18.899">No</span> <span begin="2:18.976" end="2:19.557">romeo</span> <span begin="2:19.557" end="2:19.735">in</span><span begin="2:19.735" end="2:19.927">side</span> <span begin="2:19.927" end="2:20.109">of</span> <span begin="2:20.109" end="2:20.505">me,</span> <span begin="2:20.505" end="2:20.683">to</span> <span begin="2:20.683" end="2:20.877">be</span><span begin="2:20.877" end="2:21.376">gin</span> <span begin="2:21.376" end="2:21.538">with</span> <span begin="2:21.538" end="2:21.713">be</span> <span begin="2:21.713" end="2:22.263">proud</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的内心没有罗密欧，开始时是骄傲的</span></p><p begin="2:22.263" end="2:24.754" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.263" end="2:22.429">In</span> <span begin="2:22.429" end="2:22.580">my</span> <span begin="2:22.580" end="2:22.911">head</span> <span begin="2:22.911" end="2:23.077">would</span> <span begin="2:23.077" end="2:23.254">be</span> <span begin="2:23.254" end="2:23.672">time</span> <span begin="2:23.672" end="2:23.849">pa</span><span begin="2:23.849" end="2:24.039">tient</span> <span begin="2:24.039" end="2:24.272">through</span> <span begin="2:24.272" end="2:24.458">the</span> <span begin="2:24.458" end="2:24.754">fights</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我有耐心经历这些斗争</span></p><p begin="2:24.888" end="2:28.105" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.888" end="2:25.101">On</span> <span begin="2:25.101" end="2:25.264">this</span> <span begin="2:25.264" end="2:25.728">stage</span> <span begin="2:25.728" end="2:25.901">we</span> <span begin="2:25.901" end="2:26.076">call</span> <span begin="2:26.076" end="2:26.405">life,</span> <span begin="2:26.405" end="2:26.605">we</span> <span begin="2:26.605" end="2:26.814">can</span> <span begin="2:26.814" end="2:27.260">glide</span> <span begin="2:27.260" end="2:27.440">you</span> <span begin="2:27.440" end="2:27.631">and</span> <span begin="2:27.631" end="2:28.105">I</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个被叫做生活的舞台，我们可以一起滑翔</span></p><p begin="2:28.105" end="2:31.259" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.105" end="2:28.257">Com</span><span begin="2:28.257" end="2:28.444">pli</span><span begin="2:28.444" end="2:28.645">cat</span><span begin="2:28.645" end="2:28.833">ed</span> <span begin="2:28.833" end="2:29.028">from</span> <span begin="2:29.028" end="2:29.230">the</span> <span begin="2:29.230" end="2:29.621">start,</span> <span begin="2:29.621" end="2:29.795">so</span> <span begin="2:29.795" end="2:29.996">we</span> <span begin="2:29.996" end="2:30.219">aim</span><span begin="2:30.219" end="2:30.452">ing</span> <span begin="2:30.452" end="2:30.617">for</span> <span begin="2:30.617" end="2:30.783">the</span> <span begin="2:30.783" end="2:31.259">stars</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从最初的复杂开始，我们就试图变为明星</span></p><p begin="2:31.542" end="2:34.795" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.542" end="2:31.950">Start</span> <span begin="2:31.950" end="2:32.151">with</span> <span begin="2:32.151" end="2:32.354">the</span> <span begin="2:32.354" end="2:32.603">sen</span><span begin="2:32.603" end="2:32.773">ti</span><span begin="2:32.773" end="2:33.158">ment,</span> <span begin="2:33.557" end="2:33.854">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="2:33.854" end="2:33.989">a</span> <span begin="2:33.989" end="2:34.209">gen</span><span begin="2:34.209" end="2:34.372">tle</span><span begin="2:34.372" end="2:34.795">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而起初的情感，我是一个绅士</span></p><p begin="2:34.418" end="2:36.834" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:34.418" end="2:34.738">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:34.738" end="2:35.154">be</span> <span begin="2:35.154" end="2:35.331">the</span> <span begin="2:35.331" end="2:35.711">one</span> <span begin="2:35.711" end="2:36.102">to</span> <span begin="2:36.102" end="2:36.466">catch</span> <span begin="2:36.466" end="2:36.834">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以抓住你</span></p><p begin="2:36.834" end="2:40.281" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:36.834" end="2:37.250">When</span> <span begin="2:37.250" end="2:37.699">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:37.898" end="2:38.496">falling</span> <span begin="2:38.496" end="2:38.890">from</span> <span begin="2:38.890" end="2:39.184">the</span> <span begin="2:39.184" end="2:40.281">sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你从天空坠落时</span></p><p begin="2:40.649" end="2:43.918" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:40.649" end="2:41.053">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:41.053" end="2:41.503">be</span> <span begin="2:41.503" end="2:41.653">the</span> <span begin="2:41.653" end="2:41.996">one</span> <span begin="2:41.996" end="2:42.394">to</span> <span begin="2:42.394" end="2:42.826">hold</span> <span begin="2:42.826" end="2:43.202">you</span> <span begin="2:43.202" end="2:43.918">baby</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将抓住你</span></p><p begin="2:44.051" end="2:46.338" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:44.051" end="2:44.225">To</span><span begin="2:44.225" end="2:44.644">geth</span><span begin="2:44.644" end="2:44.781">er</span> <span begin="2:44.781" end="2:45.152">we</span> <span begin="2:45.152" end="2:45.501">can</span> <span begin="2:45.501" end="2:46.338">fly</span><spa